  "takeaway": "Boston blew a 15-point third-quarter lead and committed 26 turnovers, the last by Jayson Tatum with 3.8 seconds left, as Atlanta won 87–86. The Celtics still reach the NBA Cup quarterfinals as the East wild card, at Detroit on Dec. 5.",
